# Build context is the repo root, but only the server image is built from it
# (apps/server/Dockerfile). Allowlist what that build needs; ignore everything else
# (other apps, .git, .local, secrets, node_modules, env files, ...).
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/server

# Never ship local artifacts or secrets from the allowlisted tree
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
apps/server/fly.toml
